Dialogue: 5,0:04:26.87,0:04:29.52,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}冷静を貫いた
Dialogue: 5,0:04:29.52,0:04:31.87,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Only I know the truth
Dialogue: 5,0:04:31.87,0:04:34.77,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}僕だけが僕を知ってんだから
Dialogue: 4,0:03:19.53,0:03:23.61,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}誰もいない今日は二度こない一人はただ怖い
Dialogue: 4,0:03:23.61,0:03:28.77,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}それでも降りかかる抗えない役割り
Dialogue: 4,0:03:28.77,0:03:32.97,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}「お前のせいだ　お前のせいだ」指は指すなよ
Dialogue: 4,0:03:32.97,0:03:35.47,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}僕は解ってんだ　達観してんだ
Dialogue: 4,0:03:35.47,0:03:38.47,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}妙に必死なとこズレてて笑える^_^
Dialogue: 4,0:03:38.47,0:03:43.12,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}世界の台本破り　台詞は噛み砕き
Dialogue: 4,0:03:43.29,0:03:48.02,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}わかったフリで己に従え
Dialogue: 4,0:03:56.67,0:04:01.37,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}演じよう　望み通り
Dialogue: 4,0:04:01.37,0:04:06.22,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}讃えよう　経験値
Dialogue: 4,0:04:06.22,0:04:08.02,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}剥き出しの煩悩
Dialogue: 4,0:04:08.02,0:04:10.77,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}セオリーなんて壊した
Dialogue: 4,0:04:10.77,0:04:13.12,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}Only I know the truth
Dialogue: 4,0:04:13.12,0:04:15.47,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}僕だけが僕を知ってんの
Dialogue: 4,0:04:15.47,0:04:20.12,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}お前を　守り抜き
Dialogue: 4,0:04:20.12,0:04:24.97,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}側に居よう　救いたい
